# 统一换行符，避免跨平台 diff 噪音
* text=auto eol=lf

# 图片与视频按二进制处理，不做文本 diff
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif  binary
*.mp4  binary
*.webm binary
*.mp3  binary
*.wav  binary

